WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.700
Wow. This is the future of speech to text.

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:08.090
Press your shortcut and just talk.

3
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.080
“Rename this function”

4
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.960
Highlight the code you mean, no copying needed.

5
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.940
“and make the empty state look like this.”

6
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.710
Take a screenshot to show what you want.

7
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.835
Press again, and Agent Flow pastes it all in one go,

8
00:00:24.835 --> 00:00:27.420
so your agent can see what you were looking at.

9
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.780
Agent Flow. Open source, for Mac.
